[00:15.85] Hot chili peppers in the blistering sun
[00:21.19] Dust on my face and my cape
[00:27.23] Me and Magdalena on the run
[00:33.36] I think this time we shall escape
[00:40.17] Sold my guitar to the baker's son
[00:45.75] For a few crumbs and a place to hide
[00:52.47] But I can get another one
[00:57.10] And I'll play for Magdalena as we ride
[01:04.18] No llores, mi querida
