[01:10.31] Soon the horse will take us to Durango
[01:15.77] Agarrame, mi vida
[01:19.55] Soon the desert will be gone
[01:22.33] Soon you will be dancing the fandango
[01:29.40] Past the Aztec ruins and the ghosts of our people
[01:34.56] Hoofbeats like castanets on stone
